       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-FINKE-GENEPLORE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GENEPLORE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GEN-COHESION-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EXP-EMERGENCE-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SERENDIPITY-BRANCH-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ENTROPY-BOUNDED-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GENEPLORE-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GENEPLORE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-GENEPLORE-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GENEPLORE-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-COHESION-AND-EMERGENCE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SERENDIPITY-AND-ENTROPY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GENEPLORE-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-COHESION-AND-EMERGENCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GEN-COHESION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EXP-EMERGENCE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SERENDIPITY-AND-ENTROPY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SERENDIPITY-BRANCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENTROPY-BOUNDED-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GENEPLORE-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GEN-COHESION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-EXP-EMERGENCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SERENDIPITY-BRANCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ENTROPY-BOUNDED-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GENEPLORE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-GENEPLORE-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GENEPLORE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-GENEPLORE-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GENEPLORE-CODE.
